  "description": "The Lookfar makes cruising and commuting easy.\n\nOne simple trigger shifter changes the gears up-or-down through all 7-speeds. The bike’s 42mm wide Continental tires feel fast on smooth ground while still confidently handling rough terrain. The Lookfar comes equipped with rack and fender mounts for lots of useful set-up options. We even chose to use normal Schrader valve tubes so you won’t need to use a special bike pump.\n\nThe Lookfar also shares similar proven geometry as our ever-popular Weekender model.\n\nAvailable in Fluorescent Yellow (S/M/L) and Black (M/L).",
